    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You roll initiative, you used an action or ability to unmanifest your eidolon, or you cast a Link Spell.</p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> An action or ability you used to unmanifest your eidolon did not involve reducing them to 0 hit points or killing them.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The boundaries of planes are at your fingertips, and you are ever ready to summon entities through them. If you use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.n5vwBnLSlIXL9ptp]{Manifest Eidolon} by the end of your next turn, the activity or spell costs 1 fewer actions (minimum 1).</p>",
